{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I need to flag something important before we go further. I completed a bench compatibility test yesterday, and the results show that only 600 liters of the stored mixture is suitable for this skid. The remaining 300 liters contains a solvent component that the skid's seals are not rated for. I have the results in my lab notebook but haven't uploaded them to the process file yet. We should account for this split in our planning."}
```

